sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User (Admin/Viewer)
    participant FE as Vercel Frontend
    participant AUTH as Supabase Auth
    participant BE as Render Backend

    U->>FE: Login request
    FE->>AUTH: Authenticate (password/OAuth)
    AUTH-->>FE: Access token + refresh token
    FE->>BE: API request with JWT
    BE->>AUTH: Validate token signature/claims
    AUTH-->>BE: Valid/invalid
    BE-->>FE: Authorized response or 401
    FE->>AUTH: Refresh token (on expiry)
    AUTH-->>FE: Rotated tokens
